_researcher","skin":null},"stage":null}],"costumes":[],"weapons":[],"profile":{"Age":[27],"Height":[157],"Weight":[44]},"tribes":["魅魔"],"story":"佩吉，魅魔镇研究员。\n\n主要研究对象是人类与怪物，对自己的研究充满热情，不畏涉险。佩吉不仅向外界发表认真拟写的研究成果报告，也希望有一天能著书一本，名曰‘魅魔镇，不为人知的生态词典’。此书是包含所有魅魔镇生态学知识的综合研究报告。\n\n佩吉的一副眼镜是为了专注研究而佩戴的饰品，因为摘下眼镜，就会迷惑周边所有生物。","storyKey":"profile_succubus_researcher_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=229","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=229","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"succubus_researcher","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["500年前的生物居然保存得如此完好无损…！"],"enUS":["These creatures from 500 years ago are so well preserved...!"],"jaJP":["500年前の生き物たちがこんなにきれいに保存されているなんて…！"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_researcher_1_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["挺有意思的。"],"enUS":["That's really interesting."],"jaJP":["本当に興味深いですね"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_researcher_1_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["这将成为世纪大发现！"],"enUS":["This is going to be the discovery of the century!"],"jaJP":["これは世紀の大発見になるでしょう！"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_researcher_1_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["很有趣的观点。"],"enUS":["That's an interesting opinion."],"jaJP":["面白い意見でした"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_researcher_1_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["有新邮件。"],"enUS":["There's new mail!"],"jaJP":["メールが来ましたね"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_researcher_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
